ils> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d20c82b1-fafd-4513-ad60-31531027771a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d20c82b1-fafd-4513-ad60-31531027771a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vilmina\" title=\"Vilmina\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Vilmina.png/25px-Portrait_Vilmina.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Vilmina.png/38px-Portrait_Vilmina.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Vilmina.png/50px-Portrait_Vilmina.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vilmina\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Portrait_Vilmina.png/25px-Portrait_Vilmina.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Portrait_Vilmina.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vilmina\" title=\"Vilmina\">Vilmina</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Darling,\n</p><p><br>\nIn my apron I keep the memory\n</p><p>of the conch you offered me,\n</p><p>Salty-smooth inside. My love - \n</p><p>Think you I could forget\n</p><p>the finest hour of my life?\n</p><p><br>\nNorya\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-